### ✅ 补充后的完整 `InitPll` 函数（基于你的代码）

```c
//---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Example: InitPll:
//---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// This function initializes the PLLCR register.
// It also ensures the PLL is locked and the system clock is properly switched.
//---------------------------------------------------------------------------

void InitPll(Uint16 val, Uint16 divsel)
{
    // Check if the current PLLCR value is different from the desired value
    if (SysCtrlRegs.PLLCR.bit.DIV != val)
    {
        // Ensure the watchdog is disabled before entering the loop
        DisableDog();

        // Step 1: Turn off MCLKOFF to allow the PLL to be reconfigured
        EALLOW;
        SysCtrlRegs.PLLSTS.bit.MCLKOFF = 1;
        EDIS;

        // Step 2: Set the new PLLCR value
        EALLOW;
        SysCtrlRegs.PLLCR.bit.DIV = val;
        EDIS;

        // Step 3: Wait for the PLL to lock
        while (SysCtrlRegs.PLLSTS.bit.PLLLOCKS != 1)
        {
            // Uncomment to service the watchdog if needed
            // ServiceDog();
        }

        // Step 4: Turn off MCLKOFF to allow the system clock to switch to the new PLL
        EALLOW;
        SysCtrlRegs.PLLSTS.bit.MCLKOFF = 0;
        EDIS;

        // Step 5: Enable the watchdog again (if disabled)
        EnableDog();
    }
}
```

